#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understanding high availability and disaster recovery for Quantum Compute {#understanding-high-availability-and-disaster-recovery-for-quantum-compute}"
msgstr "Memahami ketersediaan tinggi dan pemulihan bencana untuk Quantum Compute {#understanding-high-availability-and-disaster-recovery-for-quantum-compute}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "High availability (HA) is the ability for a service to remain operational and accessible in the presence of unexpected failures. Disaster recovery is the process of recovering the service instance to a working state. IBM Quantum Compute Service customers are not responsible for disaster recovery planning or actions.\n"
msgstr "Ketersediaan tinggi (HA) adalah keupayaan sesuatu perkhidmatan untuk kekal beroperasi dan boleh diakses semasa berlakunya kegagalan yang tidak dijangka. Pemulihan bencana adalah proses memulihkan instans perkhidmatan ke keadaan berfungsi. Pelanggan IBM Quantum Compute Service tidak bertanggungjawab untuk perancangan atau tindakan pemulihan bencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum Compute is a regional service that fulfills the defined [Service Level Objectives (SLO)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/resiliency?topic=resiliency-slo) with any paid plan. For more information, see the [Service Level Agreement (SLA)](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=i126-9268&lc=en) for IBM Cloud&reg;. For more information about the available IBM Cloud regions and data centers for Quantum Compute, see [Service and infrastructure availability by location](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-services_region).\n"
msgstr "Quantum Compute adalah perkhidmatan serantau yang memenuhi [Objektif Tahap Perkhidmatan (SLO)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/resiliency?topic=resiliency-slo) yang ditetapkan dengan sebarang pelan berbayar. Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [Perjanjian Tahap Perkhidmatan (SLA)](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=i126-9268&lc=en) untuk IBM Cloud&reg;. Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang rantau dan pusat data IBM Cloud yang tersedia untuk Quantum Compute, lihat [Ketersediaan perkhidmatan dan infrastruktur mengikut lokasi](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-services_region).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "High availability architecture {#high-availability-architecture}"
msgstr "Seni bina ketersediaan tinggi {#high-availability-architecture}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "High availability features {#high-availability-features}"
msgstr "Ciri-ciri ketersediaan tinggi {#high-availability-features}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This service is provisioned across three zones in a multi-zone region with no single point of failure. API requests are routed through a load balancer to the HA instance nodes, each in a different zone.\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan ini disediakan merentas tiga zon dalam rantau berbilang zon tanpa titik kegagalan tunggal. Permintaan API dihalakan melalui pengimbang beban ke nod instans HA, setiap satu di zon yang berbeza.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an HA instance node or zone fails, the service continues to run API requests through to the surviving HA instance nodes.  No noticeable degradation of service occurs during a zonal failure.\n"
msgstr "Jika nod instans HA atau zon gagal, perkhidmatan terus menjalankan permintaan API melalui nod instans HA yang masih bertahan. Tiada penurunan perkhidmatan yang ketara berlaku semasa kegagalan zon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is available in the following regions:\n"
msgstr "Ia tersedia di rantau berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Washington DC (us-east)\n"
msgstr "Washington DC (us-east)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Frankfurt (eu-de)\n"
msgstr "Frankfurt (eu-de)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disaster recovery {#disaster-recovery}"
msgstr "Pemulihan bencana {#disaster-recovery}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disaster recovery (DR) covers the steps required to restore IBM Quantum Compute Service to a working state after a regional failure or other major incident.\n"
msgstr "Pemulihan bencana (DR) merangkumi langkah-langkah yang diperlukan untuk memulihkan IBM Quantum Compute Service ke keadaan berfungsi selepas kegagalan serantau atau insiden besar lain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM responsibilities {#ibm-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Tanggungjawab IBM {#ibm-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM is responsible for the following disaster recovery tasks:\n"
msgstr "IBM bertanggungjawab ke atas tugas pemulihan bencana berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restoring or rebuilding the provisioning environments and resources in the affected region.\n"
msgstr "Memulihkan atau membina semula persekitaran dan sumber penyediaan di rantau yang terjejas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically recovering and restoring IBM Quantum Compute Service capabilities to normal operations following a regional or major incident.\n"
msgstr "Memulihkan secara automatik keupayaan IBM Quantum Compute Service kepada operasi biasa berikutan insiden serantau atau besar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your responsibilities {#your-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Tanggungjawab anda {#your-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a regional failure occurs, IBM recommends the following course of action.\n"
msgstr "Jika berlaku kegagalan serantau, IBM mengesyorkan tindakan berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Switch to an alternate region (recommended)**\n"
msgstr "**Beralih ke rantau alternatif (disyorkan)**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your workload allows it, provision a new IBM Quantum Compute Service [instance](/guides/instances) in the alternate region and resubmit any impacted jobs there. This is the fastest path to resuming operations.\n"
msgstr "Jika beban kerja anda membenarkannya, sediakan [instans](/guides/instances) IBM Quantum Compute Service baharu di rantau alternatif dan hantar semula sebarang tugas yang terjejas di sana. Ini ialah cara terpantas untuk menyambung semula operasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You might not be able to switch regions if, for example:\n"
msgstr "Anda mungkin tidak dapat beralih rantau jika, contohnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your work requires specific qubit characteristics that are only available in the affected region.\n"
msgstr "Kerja anda memerlukan ciri qubit tertentu yang hanya tersedia di rantau yang terjejas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regulatory or data-residency requirements prevent you from using a different region.\n"
msgstr "Keperluan peraturan atau kediaman data menghalang anda daripada menggunakan rantau yang berbeza.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Wait for service recovery in your region**\n"
msgstr "**Tunggu pemulihan perkhidmatan di rantau anda**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If switching regions is not an option, wait for IBM to recover the service in your region. IBM will communicate status and progress through the [IBM Cloud status page](https://cloud.ibm.com/status). After recovery is confirmed, resubmit any impacted jobs.\n"
msgstr "Jika beralih rantau bukan pilihan, tunggu IBM memulihkan perkhidmatan di rantau anda. IBM akan menyampaikan status dan kemajuan melalui [halaman status IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/status). Selepas pemulihan disahkan, hantar semula sebarang tugas yang terjejas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional responsibilities {#additional-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Tanggungjawab tambahan {#additional-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a full breakdown of IBM and customer responsibilities during a disaster recovery event, see [Disaster recovery](/guides/responsibilities#disaster-recovery) in the Responsibilities topic.\n"
msgstr "Untuk pecahan penuh tanggungjawab IBM dan pelanggan semasa peristiwa pemulihan bencana, lihat [Pemulihan bencana](/guides/responsibilities#disaster-recovery) dalam topik Tanggungjawab.\n"
